{"server":"jp","storyId":"1stact_level_a001_05_end","groupId":"1stact","stageId":"a001_05","title":"話が平行線","storyCode":"GT-5","avgTag":"戦闘後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/jp/gamedata/story/activities/a001/level_a001_05_end.txt","sourceHash":"5967663bc0ef4f0c787ece861c9c70370386485d2683c60219eddda1efb5c00b","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"強敵であるスカジと次々と湧いて出て来る賞金稼ぎ達に直面し、グラニはキャロルを援護するため撤退を余儀なくされる。しかし、洞窟の奥深くで彼女を待っているのは、見慣れた仲間だった。","blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第五关（后）"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_caveentrance"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"グラニ","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"ぐっ……！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賞金稼ぎ","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"こ、このクソチビがぁ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賞金稼ぎ","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"血まみれになりながら、まだ俺たちの邪魔をしようってのか――！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"グラニ","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"ヘンッだ。このくらいの傷、いつもの訓練よりずっと軽いよ！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賞金稼ぎ","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"ぐっ――"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"グラニ","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"これで倒したのは何人目…？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"グラニ","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"ううん、人数なんてどうでもいいや…。これで全員止めたはず――"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"グラニ","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"じ、地震？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"グラニ","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"あれは……岩盤が崩れて穴が？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"スカジ","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"……。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"グラニ","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"ウソでしょ？　あんなに厚い岩を破って来たの？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賞金稼ぎ","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"おい、ここから中に入れるぞ！　進め！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"グラニ","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"ダメ…。スカジの開けた穴から敵が入ってくる！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"グラニ","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"早くキャロルのところへ――"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"スカジ","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"止まりなさい。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"グラニ","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"スカジ――"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"グラニ","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"……。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"グラニ","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"山に穴を開けて無理やり道を作るなんて、ロドスで流れてた噂は本当だったんだね。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"スカジ","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"あの子はどこ？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"グラニ","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"教えられないよ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"スカジ","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"あれに目をつけてるのは私一人じゃない。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"スカジ","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"あなたに言うことを聞かせるためには、一度徹底的な教育が必要かしら？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"グラニ","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"何の説明もなく急にキャロルを連れて行くって言われて、はいそうですかって渡せるわけないじゃない！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"スカジ","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"あなたはロドスの任務を……邪魔するつもり？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"グラニ","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"ロドスのどんな任務を受けてるかも教えてもらってない！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"グラニ","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"本当にロドスの任務かだって……。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"グラニ","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"それに、急に仲間を攻撃するのだっておかしいよ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"スカジ","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"誰があなたの仲間ですって？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"スカジ","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"最後にもう一度言うわ。私をあの子のところへ連れて行って。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"グラニ","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"キャロルはあたしの依頼人なの。絶対にそれはできない。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"スカジ","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"……。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"グラニ","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"クッ、うわっ……。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"グラニ","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"あの剣の軽い一振りを槍で受けただけなのに、腕が折れそうなほど重い……。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"スカジ","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"あなたのその程度の力で、彼女を守れるとでも思うの？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"グラニ","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"できるかどうかと、やるかやらないかは別だよ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"スカジ","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"――――"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"グラニ","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"あれは…。ごめん、ちょっと待って！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"グラニ","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"来るっ、避けて！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賞金稼ぎ","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"チッ、さすがに当たっただろう！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"粗暴な賞金稼ぎ","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"んん？　当たっ……てない！？　クソッ、ピンピンしてやがる！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"スカジ","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"……またあなたたちなの？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賞金稼ぎ","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"ウッッ……！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"粗暴な賞金稼ぎ","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"お、おい！　や、厄星！　大尉を怪我させたのはお前だろう！　今日という今日はこの落とし前――"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"グラニ","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"チャンスだ！　今のうちに！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賞金稼ぎ","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"そこのチビ、お前も逃すかよ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"グラニ","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"いやいや、今の状況、スカジだけで手一杯でしょ？　それっ！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賞金稼ぎ","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"――なっ……！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賞金稼ぎ","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"なんだ！？　あのガキ、俺たちを飛び越えただと？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"グラニ","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"スカジ、あたしは先に行くから！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"スカジ","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"あなた……。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"グラニ","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"ごめんね！　少し頭を冷やして任務について教えてくれる気になったら、キャロルのことも考えてあげるから！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"スカジ","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"止まりなさい、どこへ行くつもり！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"グラニ","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"じゃあね！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"粗暴な賞金稼ぎ","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"オイ、なぜ奴を逃した！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賞金稼ぎ","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"あんなの早すぎる。捕まえろったって無理な話だ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"スカジ","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"……。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"粗暴な賞金稼ぎ","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"まぁいい、どのみち大尉の仇はこいつだ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"粗暴な賞金稼ぎ","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"そのデカイ図体、俺たちを飛び越えるなんて無理だろ？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"スカジ","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"もう終わりよ。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cave_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"グラニ","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"本当に分かれ道だらけだ…。ここがキャロルの言ってた財宝が眠る……。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"グラニ","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"あっ、あれは……賞金稼ぎ――"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賞金稼ぎ","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"ガハッ……助けて……。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賞金稼ぎ","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"ううう……。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"グラニ","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"ひどいやられっぷり……。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"グラニ","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"まるでボロ雑巾じゃないか……。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"グラニ","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"あれ？　でもまだスカジは入ってきてないはずだよね？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"グラニ","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"こんな所にも外から爆破されたような穴があるということは…？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"グラニ","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"つまり――"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"グラニ","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"もう、腹を決めるための時間が経ったということだね。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_010","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_010","isRemote":false,"text":"ヤレヤレ…。うまく演技できていると思っていたんだがな。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"グラニ","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"やっぱり君は――"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_220_grani","aliases":["グラニ"]},{"speakerId":"char_263_skadi","aliases":["スカジ"]}]}
